{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>紅磡海逸道8號海逸豪園發生墮樓案。今日（16日）中午約1時，據報一名女住客企圖跳樓輕生，家人慌忙報警。惜救援人員趕抵時，女事主已告墮樓，倒臥平台；救護員證實她當場不治。</p><p>死者姓黃（29歲），警方沒有檢獲遺書，但據悉她有情緒病紀錄，同時受感情問題困擾，將案件列作「自殺」處理，稍後將安排驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"紅磡海逸豪園一名女住客墮樓身亡。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221114/668867944452722688256890.jpeg/qIUgfXPLbdlYXBLEECSqS2pKVBlOrFiWM1NyGTNTchk\"/><figcaption>紅磡海逸豪園一名女住客墮樓身亡。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:39:54.947574+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:30:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:37:45.762745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:38.754340+00:00","content_hash":"1427e40f93719f0756e4f27e3ac791ff13205aea6fbcc9f8628e66cea2c5cce8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}